PRIVATE REFLECTION: {
  "1. Current Landscape & Vote Tracking": {
    "Correct Answer (C - The efficiency of natural selection)": "12 colleagues (1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 8, 9, 10, 11, 12, 15)",
